  {
   "id": 15161,
   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "0.10.1",
   "description": "<ul>\n<li>Added separate post-raid kill lists for you and each teammate, plus fixes for teammate profiles, clothing, starting weapons, and looting.</li>\n<li>Added per-teammate <strong>Proficiency</strong> settings: Vision, Precision, and Reaction, alongside Aggression.</li>\n<li>Gave Riflemen and Marksmen more distinct strengths. Followers now use a consistent proficiency baseline regardless of the selected SAIN difficulty preset.</li>\n<li>Improved combat decisions, cover use, pushing, regrouping, suppression, and aiming at exposed body parts.</li>\n<li>Improved healing and reloading, reducing interrupted medical animations and stalled recovery.</li>\n<li>Added more natural post-combat stances, glances, and an occasional squad <code>Clear</code> callout.</li>\n<li>Improved <strong>Contact</strong> and <strong>Suppress</strong> commands. Repeating Contact can bring followers closer to check the called direction; <strong>Exit Located</strong> now gathers the squad tightly around you.</li>\n<li>Improved multi-follower combat recovery and Attention responsiveness.</li>\n<li>Improved SAIN, Menu Overhaul, and AILimit compatibilityd.</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/2676/pit-fireteam/0.10.1",
   "content_length": 1486124,
   "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1.0",
   "downloads": 830,
