  {
   "id": 15258,
   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "0.10.2",
   "description": "<ul>\n<li>Improved Marksman engagement and repositioning, reducing idle cover loops and premature regrouping. Automatic support weapons, including holster pistols, switch more reliably and remain selected when needed for close defense.</li>\n<li>Fixed unwanted weapon swapping and reload interruptions during combat, Hold commands, and patrol. Improved launcher preparation and carried-weapon top-offs.</li>\n<li>Improved healing under fire: followers keep moving toward their selected medical cover while returning fire when possible. More consistent cover arrival and route-aware recovery reduce decision loops and long detours.</li>\n<li>Optimized follower vision checks and status displays to reduce CPU overhead.</li>\n<li>Fixed the KIT LOADOUTS Purchase/EQUIP button becoming incorrectly disabled.</li>\n<li>Fixed inconsistency in recruited followers’ proficiency due to them picking up randomized difficulty settings that they spawned with during the raid.</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/2676/pit-fireteam/0.10.2",
