  {
   "id": 15278,
   "hub_id": null,
   "version": "0.10.3",
   "description": "<ul>\n<li>Updated compatibility with SAIN 4.5.1, restoring follower sound reactions and preventing SAIN from overriding follower aim-point selection.</li>\n<li>Removed the unintended SPT 4.1.3-only server dependency. Builds now use the SPT 4.1.0 baseline for the intended 4.1.x support range.</li>\n<li>Fixed dead enemy references preventing followers from resuming patrol or post-combat healing, leaving them stuck until Attention.</li>\n<li>Fixed post-combat handoff gaps while squadmates remain engaged and healing recovery timers failing to start when a heal action is reused. Added bounded Release diagnostics for prolonged post-combat waits.</li>\n<li>Fixed movement turns toward outdated enemy sightings and an invalid run-approach destination, while preserving close-threat defense and normal non-sprinting look behavior.</li>\n</ul>\n",
   "link": "https://sp-mod.com/mod/download/2676/pit-fireteam/0.10.3",
   "content_length": 1494383,
   "spt_version_constraint": "~4.1.0",
